    Q_MEANINGFUL --> Q_CHOICE_MEANINGFUL_NO
    Q_CHOICE_MEANINGFUL_YES --> Q_MULTIPLE
    Q_CHOICE_MEANINGFUL_NO --> B_NEXT_SPAN

    Q_MULTIPLE --> Q_CHOICE_MULTIPLE_YES
